Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=22}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.43,0:01:55.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:58.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You look like you're having\Na really bad day or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:02:02.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I've already demonstrated my way\Nof the Six Blades to these pathetic humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.39,0:02:05.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and there's no way you can hope\Nto defeat me in that condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:07.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, just shut up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.32,0:02:11.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Bro, he's taken such a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.11,0:02:16.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm sure the onset of fever caused by his\Nwounds is making him delirious, or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:19.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If that wound opens up again,\NI'm afraid he'll die for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:22.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But he doesn't have time to\Nthink about that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.98,0:02:26.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he's the only one who\Ncan fight that six-sword freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:29.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:31.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.89,0:02:32.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yosaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.69,0:02:33.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.57,0:02:34.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lend me your swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.97,0:02:36.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.83,0:02:38.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.73,0:02:39.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:40.50,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:41.43,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.49,0:02:45.10,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know how\Nmuch longer I can last.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.19,0:02:47.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big bro, here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.23,0:02:49.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.37,0:02:54.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Now you'll understand why two human\Nhands never have a chance to beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.26,0:02:55.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Six blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:56.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.39,0:02:58.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Tentacle Sword Overload!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:02:59.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:05.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Three sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:10.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Streaming wolf swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:19.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:22.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He faced all six swords,\Nand not even a scratch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:30.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perfect sword skill, with\Nperfect concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:33.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you cut me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:36.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.33,0:03:37.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.99,0:03:40.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way you'll\Nsurvive my next attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:41.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You just got lucky is all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:44.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll never beat my six\Nswords with your three!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:46.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have twice as many swords\Nas you, don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.61,0:03:47.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Six is more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:51.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was never very good at math.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:52.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:55.84,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What weight do you carry\Nupon your shoulders?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:03:59.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:02.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Six{\i0} swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:05.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.74,0:04:12.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You may have more swords than me, but mine\Nwill always carry more weight than yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:21.36,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He's only been drowned\Nfor a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:23.58,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If we can get him back\Nup, we can revive him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:26.20,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:29.59,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't swing hard enough\Nunderwater to break this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:31.00,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.32,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:33.34,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't break it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.37,0:04:36.18,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He needs oxygen now, but there's\Nno time to get an air canister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:39.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And we can't carry\Nhim up with this rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:41.43,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:48.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Weight, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:52.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It may not look like it, but my\Nswords actually weigh quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:56.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Over three hundred\Npounds each, to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.37,0:05:01.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They weigh much more than\Nyour pathetic human swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:04.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I meant the burden of... Oh, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.19,0:05:05.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Way of Six Swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.62,0:05:06.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Octopus pot stance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}New Year's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.44,0:05:11.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Open!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:14.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Body slam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:18.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cheap shot, stupid octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:19.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:20.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:21.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:24.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll never touch the ground alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Waltz of Six Swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.77,0:05:32.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll be mincemeat if you\Ntouch them for even a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:42.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.44,0:05:44.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:54.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:57.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,First you timed your roll to dodge\Nmy Tentacle Sword Overload!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.57,0:06:00.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then you slice and dice my hands\Nup like some cheap Sushi chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:04.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you make a spectacle\Nof my master swordsmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.13,0:06:06.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:08.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll tear you limb from limb!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:11.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:16.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That attack, it probably\Nopened up his wounds again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.36,0:06:18.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wish I could\Ntake his place right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.93,0:06:26.91,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if this wound would kill\Na normal man, I am not allowed to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:32.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Way of Six Swords,\NOctopus Pot Stance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time to die, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:39.50,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,My body cannot feel the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:41.71,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Must not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:43.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}New Year's Open!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:50.35,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If I'm ever going to face Hawkeye as\Nan equal, I must be extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.69,0:06:58.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}DRAGON TWISTER!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.99,0:07:18.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.97,0:07:20.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:27.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three sword... style.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.73,0:07:34.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:36.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now you finally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.55,0:07:41.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The weight I carry in my three swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:43.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:49.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:51.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now the tentacles is out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.71,0:07:55.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think it's time\Nto go rescue Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.33,0:07:56.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.19,0:07:56.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.15,0:07:58.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could you do that to Hachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.67,0:08:01.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:04.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You thought you'd\Ngotten rid of me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.15,0:08:06.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:10.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I didn't know there was anyone in all of\Nthe East Blue who could stand back up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:11.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,after one of my punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.60,0:08:12.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.77,0:08:13.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a whole bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:16.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At a certain restaurant I know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:17.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:20.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:23.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Bro! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:24.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:27.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're dead if you go\Nin the water like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.01,0:08:29.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:31.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It won't last much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.22,0:08:33.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think you ladies might\Nwant to stop chatting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.35,0:08:34.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:35.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:39.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I could get you to\Nshut up for a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.57,0:08:40.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,maybe you would have noticed\Nthat I was about to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:44.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:48.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.36,0:08:50.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He wants to try his luck in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:52.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Against a fish man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:53.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.66,0:08:57.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you they want us\Nto fight in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.43,0:09:11.91,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That man is from Cocoyashi Village!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.81,0:09:15.62,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,They've stretched out Luffy's neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:21.17,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry but this is\Nthe best I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.17,0:09:25.29,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Please try to breathe. Please come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:27.63,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I can't hold my breath much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:29.84,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to come back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.83,0:09:31.80,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.93,0:09:36.97,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}They couldn't move the stone so they\Njust moved Luffy's head above the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:41.69,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}All I have to do is break the rock apart,\Nand the situation should take care of itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:49.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahahaha!\NThis is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.19,0:09:52.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Somebody else do something\Nentertaining! Hahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:58.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! It's that old man\Nfrom the village...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.37,0:09:59.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.77,0:10:02.04,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit! He sees me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:03.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Such a pathetic attempt
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.31,0:10:05.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,at trying to keep rubber-boy alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.02,0:10:07.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll just kill you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.14,0:10:13.43,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.43,0:10:16.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You... foolish human! Hya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:21.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you really\Ntrying to fight me under water?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:23.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't even breathe down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What makes you think you can fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:28.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As you wish, foolish boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.47,0:10:31.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fishman Karate...! Dueling Hair Tether!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.94,0:10:40.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Too bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:42.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your kick is powerless down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:45.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's more of your human weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:49.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But my Fishman Karate loses\Nnothing in water. Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.95,0:10:54.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quite the contrary,\Nit's much more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:57.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fishman Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:11:01.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Underwater Bladder Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:07.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fishman Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.83,0:11:13.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Flaming... Axe Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.37,0:11:20.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Back Foot Jawbreaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Guffaw...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:30.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}... Palm Bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:54.88,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Air! Air! Air...!\NI let out too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:58.41,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe... Suffocating...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:05.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.49,0:12:07.23,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Crap! Let me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:10.13,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I need to breathe. Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:12.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have amazing stamina...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:13.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sure you're human?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:16.47,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me through now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:23.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Didn't you say something like, any\Nman who hurts a lady is just a piece of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:25.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.30,0:12:29.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at what your precious love\Nof women has gotten you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:35.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have no escape and\Nyou'll die by my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:38.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The old man and the boy he's\Ntrying to save, they'll die too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:41.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll kill Zoro and the long-nosed guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.98,0:12:44.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then I'll massacre the entire village!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:48.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And as my final pleasure, I'll\Nmurder that traitorous bitch, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:50.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:51.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're "love" is worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:56.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If it can't save you,\Nthen you protect... no one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:13:02.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not even your little girlfriend\NNami! Hahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:11.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll admit that you have\Nsome skills... but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.23,0:13:14.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... in the end you're just a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:20.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your body doesn't react well to a\Nsudden change in pressure, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:22.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:26.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have a theory about\Nwhat's gonna happen to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:29.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your organs are going\Nto explode from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:35.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Pulverizing... Pressure Plunge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.77,0:13:45.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:47.84,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't let him do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:52.73,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If I want to save Nami, the first\Nthing I have to do is save myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:04.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:07.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:09.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He just won't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.46,0:14:15.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very well, I guess\Nwe'll just have to try it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.86,0:14:19.20,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Fishmen use\Nlungs to breathe air on land.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:21.97,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,But they use their gills to\Nbreathe water down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.57,0:14:28.47,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,which means a fish's gills\Nare useless on dry land.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.61,0:14:32.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ready for your second go round?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:36.36,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And there lungs\Nare useless underwater...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:40.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,... which means forcing air into his\Ngills should suffocate this bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:50.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:53.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.36,0:14:58.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.09,0:15:00.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. He's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.59,0:15:01.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.73,0:15:02.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Half of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:03.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, half?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:05.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:09.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,First... Get your ass up here...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:11.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want to fight where I can breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:17.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You still don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.43,0:15:20.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter to me if\NI'm on land or in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:24.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am just as strong either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:27.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now you will witness the\Ntrue power of Fishman Karate...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:33.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I punched you before, that was\Njust a sample of things to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.07,0:15:39.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}My ultimate attack, is ten times as powerful\Nand the chances you'll survive it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.51,0:15:42.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... are zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:44.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:50.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You said my love was worthless?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.12,0:15:53.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Shoulder!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.49,0:15:57.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't protect anyone, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:16:03.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ribs! Back! Chest! Legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:15.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Son of a bitch...! Thousand Brick Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:22.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And now... Face Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.26,0:16:45.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now it's done... He won't be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:03.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kuroobi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.31,0:17:06.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hachi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.45,0:17:10.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In the end\Nthey're all just seafood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.32,0:17:12.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A fish can't fight a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.35,0:17:16.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know what he was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:18.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This game is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:22.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bastards...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:26.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've killed my brothers\None after the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.20,0:17:31.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I've let you\Nget too carried away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:35.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.89,0:17:37.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy's half okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.36,0:17:38.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:41.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It means he's alive\Nfor the time being...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.80,0:17:46.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}but if we want him fully back on dry land,\NI've got to go back in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:51.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But something tells me\Nugly over there won't let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:56.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Amazing... really amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.98,0:18:00.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those guys... beat two\Nof Arlong's best fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:07.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm done... I can't hold my breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.99,0:18:10.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take my place. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.49,0:18:12.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He spit out a bunch of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.33,0:18:13.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did I miss anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:16.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're doing great. Everyone's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.23,0:18:19.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For the first time...\NI think I have hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.73,0:18:22.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These guys have fought so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:25.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We may actually be set free!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:35.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Choo. What a pain in the ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.77,0:18:38.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That long nose freak\Nsure could run forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:44.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it took just one blast from my\Nsquirt gun to take him out completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:47.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess I should head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:49.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's all over by now, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.57,0:18:54.20,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It worked! I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:18:58.29,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I am so glad I made the\NKetchup Star for such occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.29,0:19:00.83,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He thinks he killed me\Nwith a water blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.75,0:19:04.58,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Run along now! Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.82,0:19:08.38,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,These guys\Nare totally freakin' nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.49,0:19:10.50,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what I'm doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:18.60,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,They destroyed an entire village\Nand killed everyone in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:22.64,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I know Nami can't do this\Nall on her own but seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:27.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm hearing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:29.77,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't mind hiding from death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:31.69,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Death is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:35.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Let's see. I'm covered in fake blood\Nbut I need to look a little more beat up
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:37.66,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,like I fought bravely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:41.45,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey I know what's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:44.91,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Dirt. Yeah, I'm too clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.93,0:19:47.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey... "I'm sorry, I got lost."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.99,0:19:49.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:54.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. "I did my best,\Nbut he got me." Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:57.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"I was this close to the\Nbastard, and he got away."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.49,0:19:59.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That sounds better. Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.33,0:20:01.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sounds like I'm trying too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.67,0:20:03.92,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We're friends...\NRight...? So get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.92,0:20:07.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How 'bout... "Don't cry Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.03,0:20:09.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We all did the very best we could."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:12.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Never in my life\Ndid I imagine I'd lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:16.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or... "Everybody fought very bravely."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:19.52,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,But the truth... is that our\Nidiot Captain is far better
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.52,0:20:21.78,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,than a gang who'd prey on a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.52,0:20:25.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe... "I nearly died myself."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:28.21,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's for my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.35,0:20:30.46,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This was my only choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.72,0:20:36.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Nami... No, to tell the truth,\Nmy injuries aren't bad at all, really."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:38.56,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Nami was crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:42.35,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Do they need any more reason\Nthan that to put their lives on the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.36,0:20:44.96,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,To make a choice\Nlike that when you're only ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:47.89,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know how hard that\Nmust have been for Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.04,0:20:59.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I fought... bravely...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.81,0:21:04.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never quit... Yeah... that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.31,0:21:09.25,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:11.33,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,... a liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:20.17,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing but a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.17,0:21:23.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:28.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh...? You're still alive. Choo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.14,0:21:31.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right, Big Lips...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.98,0:21:35.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It takes more than water\Nto kill someone like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:35.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Choo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.14,0:21:40.81,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,When I left\Nhome, I left everything behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.81,0:21:44.24,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Peace... Safety...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.85,0:21:47.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,When you live your life on the edge,\Nyou savor every moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.75,0:21:50.79,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why they're\Nable to laugh so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.82,0:21:54.32,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the reason I went to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.32,0:21:57.88,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I want to laugh that way too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.03,0:21:59.83,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And if I don't\Nfight with all I've got,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.83,0:22:03.89,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,then I don't deserve to be on\Nthe same ship with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.91,0:22:08.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I will never be able\Nto face my friends again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.77,0:22:21.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fool... You were better\Noff pretending to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.08,0:22:25.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The human brain is\Nan absolute waste of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.25,0:22:27.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Choo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.01,0:22:30.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I... don't feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.55,0:22:34.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...\NI'm just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.89,0:22:36.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.29,0:22:39.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:42.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp Rubberband of Doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.10,0:22:47.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Choo. Arrrgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.03,0:22:52.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crap...! Where'd that\Nstupid son of a bitch go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.03,0:22:56.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.51,0:22:59.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Special Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.74,0:23:00.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Saké?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.55,0:23:01.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lead Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.69,0:23:07.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this the only way\Nyou can fight, you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.22,0:23:09.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There is no place to hide\Nfrom my squirt cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.47,0:23:19.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid, coward or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:20.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't run from this fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.97,0:23:22.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.74,0:23:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Although it doesn't really feel\Nall that great to be manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.18,0:23:28.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I lose, I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.90,0:23:30.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At least I'll die a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.00,0:23:32.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Squirt Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.38,0:23:44.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ohhh! No way...! This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.21,0:23:46.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.37,0:23:49.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why should I have to waste\Nmy time with such an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.91,0:23:52.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.78,0:23:54.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll shred you to pieces...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.91,0:23:57.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Squirt Machine Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.78,0:24:00.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How did he find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:02.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crap! Crap! Holy Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.69,0:24:05.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be a real pirate and now\Nthat I've finally gotten my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.67,0:24:08.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know I can do it. I know I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.24,0:24:09.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.54,0:24:14.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I survive this ordeal, I'll never\Npretend to be a pirate ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.10,0:24:16.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't be a coward and run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.71,0:24:20.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My fake pirate days... are over!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.97,0:24:24.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did you say is done?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.71,0:24:25.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This whole fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.98,0:24:27.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alcohol lights on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.08,0:24:30.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp Flaming Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.52,0:24:35.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aaahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.09,0:24:37.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hot, fire, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.54,0:24:39.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Water! Must find water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.03,0:24:40.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Water! Water, water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.03,0:24:40.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.87,0:24:43.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Water, water, water, water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.24,0:24:47.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.61,0:24:48.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Choo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.71,0:25:10.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.85,0:25:14.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp Hammer!\NUsopp Hammer! Usopp Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.66,0:25:15.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.54,0:25:17.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rubberband of Doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.16,0:25:18.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp Hammer! Usopp Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.19,0:25:20.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.07,0:25:32.39,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I did it! I beat... a fishman...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.68,0:25:34.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see that, loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.74,0:25:36.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I beat your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.02,0:25:43.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I actually did it...!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.42,0:25:47.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's a pirate now...?!\NI am Usopp the Pirate!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=23}===============================DIALOGUE============================
